                    <TrustBadge />
                </div>
                <h1
                    class="text-4xl lg:text-6xl font-black text-white leading-tight mb-8"
                >
                    <span class="text-[#38BDF8]">Asphalt Repair</span> in 2026: Fix Any Driveway Like a Pro
                </h1>
                <p
                    class="text-xl text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-8 max-w-3xl mx-auto"
                >
                    Potholes, spider cracks, sunken low spots, and crumbling edges don't fix themselves—they spread. The good news? Most asphalt repairs are a weekend DIY job that costs a fraction of repaving. Here's exactly how to do it right.
                </p>
                <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
                    <a
                        href="#top-pick"
                        class="px-8 py-4 bg-[#FF4500] hover:bg-[#E63E00] text-white font-black rounded-xl shadow-lg transition-all no-underline"
